VALUES (15067, 'tt0901487', NULL, 'The Good, the Bad, the Weird', '좋은 놈, 나쁜 놈, 이상한 놈', 'movie', 2008, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbPZ0aNoF0cHisg6DubFO2eS8so.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gec3e76TRGUBx1Ut0c6yuSahVDp.jpg', 'The story of three Korean outlaws in 1930s Manchuria and their dealings with the Japanese army and Chinese and Russian bandits. The Good (a bounty hunter), the Bad (a hitman), and the Weird (a thief) battle the army and the bandits in a race to use a treasure map to uncover the riches of legend.', NULL, NULL, 4.1308, 7.16, 0, 8.0266666666666655e+00, '2026-07-20 04:02:06', '2026-10-14 23:31:09')
