VALUES (14165, 'tt0946601', NULL, 'Ruby Gloom', 'Ruby Gloom', 'tv', 2006, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnUpRoi4Z9BYthmjM9CCRwPR5vN.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cxwVDVEkIrIDoXdHtrO50RFxfs.jpg', 'Ruby Gloom is a Canadian children''s show that revolves around the titular character, Ruby, who has a unique perspective on the world. While some kids might be afraid of the dark, Ruby embraces it and finds joy in the company of strange and quirky characters like Doom Kitty, Skull Boy, Misery, Boo Boo, and Mr. Buns. Together, they navigate various adventures and challenges. The series is based on an apparel franchise of the same name. The show was produced by Nelvana and began airing on October 13, 2006 in Canada on the network YTV. It features the voices of Sarah Gadon, Emily Hampshire, Peter Keleghan, and Adrian Truss.', NULL, NULL, 5.2898, 7.2, 0, 8.68, '2026-07-31 03:33:23', '2026-10-14 23:31:09')
