VALUES (86941, 'tt7660970', NULL, 'The North Water', 'The North Water', 'tv', 2021, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CM0ca8pX1os3SJ24hsIc0nN8ph.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8IC1q0lHFwi5m8VtChLzIfmpaZH.jpg', 'Henry Drax is a harpooner and brutish killer whose amorality has been shaped to fit the harshness of his world, who will set sail on a whaling expedition to the Arctic with Patrick Sumner, a disgraced ex-army surgeon who signs up as the ship’s doctor. Hoping to escape the horrors of his past, Sumner finds himself on an ill-fated journey with a murderous psychopath. In search of redemption, his story becomes a harsh struggle for survival in the Arctic wasteland.', NULL, NULL, 6.8251, 7.354, 0, 1.0225999999999999e+01, '2026-08-08 02:23:49', '2026-10-14 23:31:09')
